### 1. 注册测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "管理员",
  "email": "admin@test.com"
}

### 2. 登录测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 新增设备测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "我的笔记本",
  "deviceType": "LAPTOP",
  "manufacturer": "Lenovo",
  "model": "ThinkPad",
  "purchasePrice": 8999
}

### 4. 查设备总花费
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1/total-cost?userId=1

### 5. Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard?userId=1

### 6. PowerShell 写入后生成设备报告
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1/analysis?userId=1
